Department: Laboratory. Description: This RFQ is an invitation to the Respondent to submit a Response to provide:
•	one (1) Pluggo RH Decappers for Beckman Coulter IRIS/DxU  ten (10) position racks for Simport 16 x 100mm round bottom tube with flanged polyethylene cap in the Core Lab Chemistry at Edmonton Base Lab in the Edmonton Zone;
•	two (2) Pluggo RH Decapper for Beckman Coulter IRIS/DxU  ten (10) position racks for BD Vacutainer Plastic Urinalysis Tube, Round Bottom, Yellow rubber stopper, 10.0 mL draw volume, 16mm x 100mm with no additive in the Core Lab Chemistry at Edmonton Base Lab in the Edmonton Zone;
•	one (1) Standard Pluggo Decapper and carousels of each size compatible with BD Tubes in the Chemistry at Foothills Medical Centre in the Calgary Zone; and
•	one (1) Kapsafe-LS Recapper for Roche Diagnostics five (5) Position Standard Sample Racks in the Chemistry at Foothills Medical Centre in the Calgary Zone
for a one-time purchase, utilizing HSS’ purchase order terms and conditions all the more particularly described in Section 3 of this Schedule “A”. Project closes Aug 20, 2026 2:00 PM MDT.

