Department: Faculty of Fine Arts and Communications. Description: The University intends to establish a prequalified roster of suppliers capable of supporting one or more equipment supply and service requirements on an as-needed basis. These requirements may include, but are not limited to:
•	the supply of professional-grade camera, audio, video, lighting, recording, and production equipment;
•	related accessories, peripherals, components, and consumables;
•	music and performance-related equipment and accessories, where required to support the University's audiovisual, instructional, performance, recording, or production needs;
•	installation, integration, and configuration services;
•	control system programming, as required; and
•	maintenance, repair, lifecycle, and technical support services. Project closes Oct 26, 2026 1:00 PM MDT.
